{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"agent_message","text":"The first full campaign passes through legal movement and bomb inputs, with finite lives and production rules: all 26 hatchlings reach safety in both solo and simultaneous co-op tests. Those tests caught and fixed two movement bugs—enemies skipping junction decisions and turtles travelling an extra cell after release. I’m now checking the bundled game’s screens, controls, audio, and online lifecycle.\n"}}
