e-Shell-Service-Turtles-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-033712\"}, INTERVIEW: {\"sourceInformation\":{\"date\":\"2026-11-06 03:37:12 [... omitted end of long line]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
